CRITICAL INSTRUCTION:

This is an existing application. Do not rebuild it from scratch.

First inspect the complete existing source code, project structure, dependencies, database, authentication, APIs, encryption mechanisms, and existing features.

Extend the existing application without breaking or removing any working functionality.

